          panelPrompt: STYLE + ", white-coat Dogo Argentino pup walking out of chain-link and stacked dead cars in THE LOT, Boneguard gold #e8c55a collar with BONE tag, drifting embers of the JUNKYARD DYNASTY era, a scarred old Bullmastiff silhouette looming behind with a ledger, TOWN HALL dark on the horizon"
