          panelPrompt: STYLE + ", matte-black armored war-truck, gold trim, ram plow rolling toward the crown_citadel gate district, white Dogo Argentino standing on the hood, crimson and gold sky, the Citadel core towers ahead, Boneguard gold #e8c55a underglow"
