          panelPrompt: STYLE + ", St. Bernard planted like architecture in a FACTORY ROW alley mouth, Bruiser plated shoulders spread wide, a soft gold #e8c55a aura ring soaking sparks and debris, a line of smaller Boneguard dogs sheltered behind him, tag paint BONE on the brick"
